Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgl1, libx11-6, libxi6, libxcursor1, libxinerama1, libxrandr2, libxxf86vm1
Recommends: zenity, shared-mime-info, desktop-file-utils
Installed-Size: 129020
Maintainer: Kevin Cherry <17479255+kcherry497@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: ClaudeDocFormat (.cdf) viewer and editor
 CDF is a portable document format for operational notes, change logs,
 runbooks, and tabular content. A .cdf file is pretty-printed JSON with
 a defined schema; this package ships both the GUI editor (cdf-gui) and
 a terminal viewer/editor (cdf).
 .
 File → Open uses the native GTK dialog via zenity when available.
